msgstr "เชื่อมต่ออัตโนมัติเมื่อแอปเริ่มต้น"

#. Checkbox at the bottom of the connect form: show desktop notifications for this network's messages; the browser's permission ask fires when it is first switched on.
#: client/components/Windows/Connect.vue:280
