msgctxt "help.autocomplete.intro"
msgid "To auto-complete nicknames, channels, commands, and emoji, type one of the characters below to open a suggestion list. Use the {up} and {down} keys to highlight an item, and insert it by pressing {tab} or {enter} (or by clicking the desired item)."
